   "title": "Civil group files police complaint against agriculture minister over farmland survey",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261026/civil-group-files-police-complaint-against-agriculture-minister-over-farmland-survey",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:47:04 GMT",
   "_dt": 1792986424.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "A civic group has filed a complaint with police against Agriculture Minister Song Mi-ryung over the government's ongoing farmland survey, accusing her of abusing power, sources said Monday. The Seoul Metropolitan Police Agency received the complaint from the People's Welfare Countermeasure Committee on Sunday, claiming Song pressed ahead with the survey without sufficient consultation from farmers, causing anxiety among them, according to the sources.",
   "summary_zh": "消息人士周一称，一个公民团体已就政府持续开展的农田调查向警方控告农林畜产食品部长宋美岭，指控她滥用权力。据消息人士称，首尔 Metropolitan Police Agency 周日收到人民福利对策委员会的投诉，称宋美岭在未充分征求农民意见的情况下推进调查，引发农民焦虑。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "A civic group has filed a complaint with police against Agriculture Minister Song Mi-ryung over the government's ongoing farmland survey, accusing her of abusing power, sources said Monday. The Seoul Metropolitan Police Agency received the complaint from the People's Welfare Countermeasure Committee on Sunday, claiming Song pressed ahead with the survey without sufficient consultation from farmers, causing anxiety among them, according to the sources. The government launched the comprehensive nationwide survey earlier this year in an effort to determine the actual ownership of farmland and prevent it from being used as a speculative asset. Critics, however, have voiced concerns over the survey, arguing that it could infringe on the property rights of farmers",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
