   "title": "Seoul stocks extend losses Monday morning ahead of earnings reports, Fed decision",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261026/seoul-stocks-extend-losses-monday-morning-ahead-of-earnings-reports-fed-decision",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
