   "title": "‘Replace complexity with compassion’ – Cardinal Turkson urges students",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/replace-complexity-with-compassion-cardinal-turkson-urges-students/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:33:00 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792981980.0,
   "ageDays": 0.07,
   "summary": "The Chancellor of the Catholic University of Ghana, Cardinal Peter Appiah Turkson, has urged students to embrace compassion and collective responsibility as they prepare for a world shaped by conflict, technological disruption and uncertainty.",
   "summary_zh": "加纳天主教大学校监、枢机主教彼得·阿皮亚·图尔克松 urges 学生们拥抱同情与集体责任，为他们即将面对一个受冲突、技术颠覆和不确定性塑造的世界做好准备。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "The Chancellor of the Catholic University of Ghana, Cardinal Peter Appiah Turkson, has urged students to embrace compassion and collective responsibility as they prepare for a world shaped by conflict, technological disruption and uncertainty.",
