   "title": "CBN directive may trigger data centre capacity crisis –Nugi boss",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/cbn-directive-may-trigger-data-centre-capacity-crisis-nugi-boss/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
   "source": "Punch（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:11 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792886411.0,
   "ageDays": 1.18,
   "summary": "Nugi Technologies founder warns the CBN’s January 2027 data localisation deadline could strain data centres, disrupt services, and increase technology cost Read More: https://punchng.com/cbn-directive-may-trigger-data-centre-capacity-crisis-nugi-boss/",
